      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INDI AIR TONIGHT (7) is racing well with four top-five finishes in succession. Good second at this track over 1660m in the most recent of them. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row but this is a race well within range. WOKKA ROCK (8) added to his recent string of strong performances last time out when runner-up over 2040m at this track, beaten a head. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go his way at some stage. Recent efforts are good enough to put him right in the finish. ITS DOWN TO DIGGER (4) is better than his last-start ninth over 1660m at this track and STUDLEIGH SUNRISE (6) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by 11 metres at this track over 1660m.",
